Dear all,
I have updated the package to v1.3.0. You may find the changes in the NEWS.md file <https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/d21b397e5c02907d27d36976e105b925cc5cb784?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3>.

In particular, I changed "create_mats" quite a bit. Please see the changes listed in the NEWS.md file above, in addition to Chapter 6.2 of the User Guide, which now goes into great detail the function arguments of "create_mats".

Chris

